---------------------------------- Actions -----------------------------------
  c confirm   t assign   s split   d discard   b break   z undo
  y confirm all   ? help   q quit

------------------------------------ Help ------------------------------------
  Assign
    t <block> <ticket>           Assign or fill idle time     t 3 ABC-12
    u <block> <n>                Take suggestion <n>          u 3 2
    r [repo]                     Remember last assignment     r
  Confirm
    c <block>                    Confirm a block              c 3
    y                            Confirm all assigned blocks  y
  Adjust
    s <block> <time> [<ticket>]  Split a block at a time      s 3 09:30 ABC-12
    b <block>                    Mark block or idle as break  b 3
    d <block>                    Discard a block              d 3
    z                            Undo last action             z
  Other
    a                            Acknowledge daily cap        a
    q                            Quit                         q
    ?                            Show this help (also: help)  ?

  Placeholders
    <block>   number from the # column
    <ticket>  ticket key, e.g. ABC-12
    <time>    time of day, HH:MM
    <n>       suggestion number
    [repo]    optional: whole repository
